WEBVTT


00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.480
May your spirit roam beyond.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.280
Farewell, Ninth Young Lady.

00:00:22.039 --> 00:00:24.160
May your spirit roam beyond.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.960
(Late Lady Fu of the Zuo Family) Farewell, Ninth Young Lady.

00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:30.559
(Chastity memorial arches in ancient China)

00:00:30.559 --> 00:00:32.159
(A Paragon of Virtue and Integrity) (are granted by the imperial court)

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:33.560
(A Paragon of Virtue and Integrity) (and erected by the clan.)

00:00:33.759 --> 00:00:35.119
(A family granted such a memorial arch)

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.200
(could greatly enhance its prestige)

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:38.640
(and clear the way to official advancement.)

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.799
(And so, around these arches,)

00:00:40.799 --> 00:00:43.159
(Grace Lost, Virtue Enduring) (countless schemes began to take shape.)

00:00:43.159 --> 00:00:44.200
(Some would even cost)

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.520
(their lives.)

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.280
May your spirit roam beyond.

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:51.200
Farewell, Ninth Young Lady.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.200
(Double Happiness)

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:18.000
Madam.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.519
A wedding procession ahead

00:01:19.519 --> 00:01:20.680
Is blocking the road.

00:01:21.159 --> 00:01:24.000
A wedding always gives way to a funeral.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:24.959
(Spirit of the Late Lady Fu of the Zuo Family)

00:01:24.959 --> 00:01:26.200
Tell them to move aside

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:27.920
And let us go first.

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:33.840
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Lady Fu of the Zuo Family)

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:39.079
My respects, Madam.

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.120
I trust you have been well.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.280
What a fortunate coincidence.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:50.640
My bride happens to be an old acquaintance of yours.

00:01:51.959 --> 00:01:53.560
Why not come and see her?

00:01:57.439 --> 00:01:59.079
Indeed, I should.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:17.255
=The Road to Splendor=

00:03:17.256 --> 00:03:19.680
(Adapted from China Literature author Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:23.040
=Episode 1=

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:25.560
(Over a month earlier) Snow turns foul on Huaying's ground.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:28.000
So how does the snow at the Fu Residence stay so spotless?

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.639
Look more closely.

00:03:29.639 --> 00:03:32.639
The blossoms are made of silk, and the snow is nothing but salt.

00:03:32.719 --> 00:03:34.879
They wouldn't want the ladies' shoes and stockings dirtied.

00:03:35.039 --> 00:03:37.439
(Hall of the Flower Goddess) You think they honor the Goddess?

00:03:37.639 --> 00:03:39.759
They are really here for Madam Yu.

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:41.520
The Yu family of Yongning Prefecture.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.280
Exactly.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.280
(Fu Residence)

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.719
(Eldest Madam, Old Madam, Fifth Madam) This event decides Tingyun's marriage.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:52.960
Nothing can go wrong.

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:09.400
(Fu Tingyun, Ninth Young Lady of the Fu Family)

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:11.600
(An Album of Erotic Paintings)

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:13.400
Look.

00:04:13.759 --> 00:04:15.360
The brushwork is exquisite.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:16.879
(Madam Zuo, Eldest Granddaughter-in-Law) Every figure looks almost alive.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.279
We have been doing business for years.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:20.480
Since you are a loyal customer,

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:21.279
I suppose

00:04:21.279 --> 00:04:22.560
I will not charge you for this one.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.279
(Admonitions for Women) All I ask in return

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.720
Is a marriage alliance.

00:04:26.879 --> 00:04:28.079
A marriage alliance?

00:04:28.079 --> 00:04:29.759
Your younger brother,

00:04:29.759 --> 00:04:30.800
Zuo Junjie,

00:04:30.959 --> 00:04:31.759
Lives with you

00:04:31.759 --> 00:04:33.160
At the Fu Residence, right?

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.600
Staying under another family's roof is tough.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:36.399
As it happens,

00:04:36.399 --> 00:04:37.279
I have a kid here

00:04:37.399 --> 00:04:38.519
Who would be

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.879
A fine match for your brother.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:41.720
That will not be necessary.

00:04:42.839 --> 00:04:44.600
He is my only brother.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:47.240
I arranged his marriage long ago.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.800
May I ask

00:04:50.399 --> 00:04:52.120
Which family's young lady he is promised to?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.680
Tingyun has beauty and brains,

00:04:54.839 --> 00:04:56.120
And a noble standing.

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:58.079
She is the perfect match for my brother.

00:04:58.519 --> 00:04:59.720
Madam Zuo,

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:01.199
You haven't heard?

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.439
Old Madam Fu

00:05:03.439 --> 00:05:05.319
Made her choice long ago.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.120
Lord Yu

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.319
Holds office in the capital.

00:05:08.319 --> 00:05:10.160
He has only one son,

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:11.879
And the boy has the makings of a top scholar.

00:05:11.879 --> 00:05:12.800
The Fu family

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:14.839
Has already prepared the east wing,

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.120
Ready to welcome him as a son-in-law.

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:19.199
Get out.

00:05:23.879 --> 00:05:24.560
They're here.

00:05:24.959 --> 00:05:25.879
They are coming.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:36.080
(Madam Yu, Wife of the Left Censor-in-Chief)

00:05:36.639 --> 00:05:37.879
Madam Yu.

00:05:38.519 --> 00:05:39.560
Old Madam Fu.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.240
I hear the esteemed Master Fan Kun resides in your household.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:44.600
I've brought my son to study under him.

00:05:44.879 --> 00:05:46.720
We'll need to stay here for a few days.

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:48.240
I hope we won't be too much of a bother.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.120
Not at all.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.680
Madam Yu, your timing is perfect.

00:05:52.839 --> 00:05:54.560
Today is the Flower Goddess Festival.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.399
(Fu Residence) The county is holding a grand ceremony.

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:58.480
You must join the festivities.

00:05:58.879 --> 00:06:00.920
Let the young ladies of Huaying

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.600
Share in some of your good fortune.

00:06:02.879 --> 00:06:04.439
You flatter me, Madam.

00:06:04.959 --> 00:06:06.560
(Yu Jingxiu, Yu Family's Young Master) To take part in such a grand celebration

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:07.680
Is a privilege for me.

00:06:10.199 --> 00:06:11.600
This is my son, Jingxiu.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.120
My respects, Old Madam Fu.

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.199
Madam Yu.

00:06:17.439 --> 00:06:20.639
My fifth son's household has a young daughter.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.639
She has been raised exceedingly well.

00:06:23.279 --> 00:06:25.000
She is today's chief celebrant.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:27.680
Later, she will adorn the Flower Goddess with blossoms.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.319
Perhaps you might say

00:06:29.319 --> 00:06:30.680
A few kind words for her

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.759
And help secure her future.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:34.800
You do me too much honor.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:40.000
What is wrong, Madam Zuo?

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:42.000
The scriptures I copied are missing.

00:06:42.399 --> 00:06:43.959
I must find them.

00:06:45.879 --> 00:06:48.040
That is my eldest grandson's widow.

00:06:48.839 --> 00:06:50.199
She has remained chaste since his death.

00:06:50.199 --> 00:06:51.720
Poor woman.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.720
She seldom comes out.

00:06:57.759 --> 00:06:59.240
By spending just a little money,

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.079
Now some are deemed above the rest before the Flower Goddess.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:06.319
In looks, character, and family standing,

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.160
(Fan Yake, Master Fan Kun's Child) Tingyun is second to none.

00:07:08.519 --> 00:07:10.279
If the chief celebrant isn't a Fu,

00:07:10.639 --> 00:07:11.560
Could it possibly be a Feng?

00:07:11.879 --> 00:07:13.600
(Miss Feng, Feng Laosi's Child) That would never be you either.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.439
You're only a schoolmaster's daughter.

00:07:17.519 --> 00:07:19.639
Just because your father taught her a few poems,

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:21.079
You cling to her day in and day out.

00:07:21.279 --> 00:07:23.680
Yet you couldn't even wrangle a place as assistant celebrant?

00:07:24.519 --> 00:07:26.399
Master Fan runs a strict household.

00:07:26.399 --> 00:07:27.759
Yake is rarely allowed out.

00:07:28.439 --> 00:07:30.800
She had no wish to attend today's ceremony.

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:32.639
I asked her to come and keep me company.

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:39.959
What a grand affair.

00:07:39.959 --> 00:07:40.639
My Lady.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:41.920
Your things have arrived.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:45.480
How beautiful.

00:07:45.839 --> 00:07:47.519
Jewelry and precious gems.

00:07:51.839 --> 00:07:53.120
What is this?

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.120
(An Album of Erotic Paintings)

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:57.279
You...

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.800
Reading such indecent books in private is bad enough,

00:07:59.959 --> 00:08:01.800
But how dare you bring such filth here?

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.439
And your family even has a chastity arch!

00:08:04.519 --> 00:08:06.040
Where did this filth come from?

00:08:06.639 --> 00:08:07.439
My Lady.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.319
(An Album of Erotic Paintings) I have no idea where it came from.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.319
My respects, Madam Yu.

00:08:14.839 --> 00:08:16.360
Madam Yu is our honored guest,

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:19.199
And all you noble ladies shine so brightly.

00:08:19.639 --> 00:08:21.240
Someone as unworthy as I am

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:22.920
Can only bask in your reflected glory

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.720
And come out to see the sun.

00:08:26.639 --> 00:08:27.920
Please, carry on.

00:08:28.439 --> 00:08:30.480
I still have scriptures to find.

00:08:33.039 --> 00:08:33.679
Madam Zuo.

00:08:35.399 --> 00:08:36.240
My Lady.

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.799
Madam Zuo said something is missing.

00:08:37.799 --> 00:08:39.440
She has ordered every room searched.

00:08:39.559 --> 00:08:41.080
Searched?

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.080
If they find

00:08:42.159 --> 00:08:43.600
Something filthy like this,

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:44.679
Nothing good will come of it.

00:08:44.879 --> 00:08:46.440
Don't drag us down with you.

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:47.240
Exactly.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:48.600
This has nothing to do with us.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:52.159
(Your late cousin's widow has repeatedly proposed a match.)

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:55.320
(She wants you to marry that good-for-nothing Zuo.)

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:57.080
(I refused.)

00:08:57.639 --> 00:09:00.039
(For a woman, marriage can make or break her life.)

00:09:00.279 --> 00:09:01.480
(Choose wisely.)

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.480
If word of this gets out,

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:04.519
Forget about ever marrying.

00:09:04.639 --> 00:09:05.759
It could cost you your life.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.519
Tingyun.

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.639
I lost something.

00:09:12.639 --> 00:09:14.200
I was hoping to look for it in here.

00:09:21.399 --> 00:09:22.120
Madam.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:23.519
That widow from earlier

00:09:23.519 --> 00:09:24.840
Has gone to the Ninth Young Lady's room.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.519
Not sure whether she'll manage to get away.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:38.960
Madam Zuo.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:47.720
What are you doing?

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:49.159
That belongs to me.

00:09:49.159 --> 00:09:50.200
Put it down.

00:09:50.279 --> 00:09:50.799
You'll break it.

00:09:50.799 --> 00:09:51.840
Leave our things alone.

00:09:51.919 --> 00:09:52.960
What are you doing?

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.360
Unbelievable!

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:55.519
Be careful.

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:56.799
You'll break it.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:57.919
Don't touch that.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.200
Zuo.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:10.879
Have you found your scriptures?

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:17.720
I don't believe...

00:10:19.399 --> 00:10:21.080
Not one of you saw anything.

00:10:21.879 --> 00:10:23.879
What do you gain by covering for her?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.799
At the Flower Goddess Festival,

00:10:26.919 --> 00:10:28.440
You're only here to make her look better.

00:10:29.919 --> 00:10:31.600
Are you suggesting

00:10:31.799 --> 00:10:33.159
That

00:10:33.159 --> 00:10:35.000
We search the young ladies themselves?

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.679
- What right do you have to search us? - How can you search us?

00:10:36.679 --> 00:10:37.600
Search us?

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:43.480
You...

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:45.200
Madam Zuo.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.799
Is this how the Fu family treats its guests?

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:48.480
Exactly.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.320
- Right. - Exactly.

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:50.440
Madam Zuo.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.399
Could your scriptures

00:10:52.399 --> 00:10:54.080
Have been left in the courtyard?

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:56.600
You

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.000
Shouldn't disturb everyone here.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:10:59.919
Come with me.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.919
In the Year of Bingwu,

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:16.960
On the Flower Festival day,

00:11:17.039 --> 00:11:19.159
Celebrants, take your places.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.039
There was only ever one chief celebrant.

00:11:27.039 --> 00:11:28.080
Only she adorned the goddess with flowers.

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:30.159
Why are there more than a dozen this year?

00:11:30.159 --> 00:11:31.320
And none is given precedence.

00:11:31.399 --> 00:11:32.279
Exactly.

00:11:32.399 --> 00:11:33.720
Weird.

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:28.639
Well, well.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:32.440
Madam Yu, you were only meant to offer one blessing.

00:12:32.799 --> 00:12:35.039
Now you will have to say a few more words.

00:12:41.159 --> 00:12:42.440
Ninth Young Lady Fu,

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.320
You are a clever one.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.320
I may be the chief celebrant,

00:12:47.679 --> 00:12:49.679
But serving the goddess is a blessing in itself.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.960
And among the officials' wives in the northwest,

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:53.039
Madam Yu is one of the most distinguished.

00:12:53.039 --> 00:12:54.279
A single word of praise from her

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:56.519
Could greatly improve a girl's marriage prospects.

00:12:57.039 --> 00:12:58.120
Such good fortune

00:12:58.360 --> 00:12:59.200
Is not mine

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.240
To enjoy alone.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.639
Rather than suffer alone for a false accusation,

00:13:02.799 --> 00:13:03.799
We may as well

00:13:03.879 --> 00:13:05.000
Finish the ceremony together

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:06.159
And share the honor.

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:09.919
Will Madam Yu really praise us?

00:13:14.879 --> 00:13:16.240
Gentle and refined.

00:13:20.559 --> 00:13:21.879
Bright-eyed and captivating.

00:13:23.559 --> 00:13:25.120
(Now that you have benefited from Miss Fu's generosity,)

00:13:25.279 --> 00:13:26.720
(you must keep her secret.)

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:33.039
A radiant smile and graceful charm.

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:35.840
Elegant and composed.

00:13:36.919 --> 00:13:38.480
A serene and refined bearing.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:42.720
A luminous presence.

00:13:44.039 --> 00:13:45.720
A beauty in full splendor.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:52.960
The ceremony is complete.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:02.559
Madam Yu,

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.879
Of the thirteen beauties you just saw,

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.840
Which one pleased you most?

00:14:08.279 --> 00:14:09.679
If I must choose

00:14:09.679 --> 00:14:11.120
One of these young ladies,

00:14:12.799 --> 00:14:15.200
It'd be the daughter of Master Fan Kun,

00:14:15.559 --> 00:14:17.320
Who teaches in your household. Is she here?

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:21.559
Who is she?

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.399
It's her.

00:14:24.399 --> 00:14:25.399
Miss Fan,

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:26.720
Please step forward.

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.519
I find Miss Fan the finest of them all.

00:14:45.399 --> 00:14:46.639
You flatter me, Madam.

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:51.519
Master Fan is well-versed in both ancient and modern texts.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.440
His daughter has inherited his fine intellect

00:14:53.759 --> 00:14:54.919
And is highly accomplished.

00:14:57.159 --> 00:14:58.480
A true young lady of distinction.

00:15:02.679 --> 00:15:04.279
What token may bind two hearts?

00:15:04.759 --> 00:15:06.279
A pair of bangles around the wrist.

00:15:07.279 --> 00:15:08.919
I present this jade bangle to you.

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:11.639
May you

00:15:12.639 --> 00:15:14.039
Be blessed with a match made in heaven

00:15:14.919 --> 00:15:16.080
And a lifetime of love and happiness.

00:15:20.559 --> 00:15:21.440
Old Madam Fu,

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.799
A servant just informed me

00:15:23.879 --> 00:15:26.440
That my son's bed was made up in the east wing.

00:15:26.799 --> 00:15:28.960
But he sleeps little when he studies,

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:30.120
And cannot bear the morning sun.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.720
The east-wing bed does not suit him.

00:15:31.919 --> 00:15:33.639
Please move him to the west wing instead.

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:41.679
Mr. Fu, you scattered salt around your home to mimic snow.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.080
(Feng Laosi, Salt Merchant) And all that salt

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:45.080
Was supplied by us.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:47.759
(Magistrate Fu of Huaying County) Now that the marriage has failed,

00:15:47.759 --> 00:15:49.879
You are forcing salt prices down instead.

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:52.080
The court has sent an Imperial Envoy

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.279
To investigate the price of salt.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.600
Please,

00:15:56.759 --> 00:15:58.080
I need your cooperation.

00:15:58.399 --> 00:16:00.120
The price truly cannot rise any further.

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:02.159
Twenty copper coins a catty is the absolute maximum.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:05.399
Others may not understand,

00:16:05.399 --> 00:16:06.559
But surely you do.

00:16:06.559 --> 00:16:07.480
The salt itself isn't expensive.

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:08.919
The permits are.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:10.240
The price of salt

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:11.840
Simply cannot be brought down.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:13.159
If you must,

00:16:13.159 --> 00:16:15.240
Arrest a couple of salt smugglers and call it done.

00:16:15.879 --> 00:16:17.039
I heard something interesting.

00:16:17.159 --> 00:16:19.679
Jiuweijiao has a shipment of salt

00:16:19.679 --> 00:16:20.759
Headed for Huaying.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:22.840
A full hundred thousand catties.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.440
Jiuweijiao?

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:26.840
Who is this person?

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.320
He's only the biggest salt smuggler

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:30.159
In the entire northwest.

00:16:30.399 --> 00:16:33.000
He has manpower, money, and supply routes.

00:16:33.279 --> 00:16:35.120
Bring him down,

00:16:35.279 --> 00:16:37.440
And you won't have to fear the salt-price investigation.

00:16:37.559 --> 00:16:39.120
With an achievement like that,

00:16:39.759 --> 00:16:41.360
A promotion is as good as yours.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:43.840
Is this Jiuweijiao easy to catch?

00:16:45.159 --> 00:16:46.320
His name says it all.

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:47.120
Think about it.

00:16:47.279 --> 00:16:48.120
He's slippery as an eel.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:49.480
Apart from his closest men,

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.120
Hardly anyone has seen his true face.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:58.000
(Zhao Ling)

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.440
Drink this toast to fortune.

00:17:00.399 --> 00:17:01.600
From this day on, here in Huaying,

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:03.960
We share the good times

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:05.519
And face the bad together.

00:17:06.039 --> 00:17:08.119
Mr. Zhao and I grew up together.

00:17:08.519 --> 00:17:09.559
He's

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:11.160
(Jin Yuanbao, Salt Shopkeeper) capable and quick-witted.

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:12.599
Stick with him,

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:13.440
And none of us will lose out.

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.599
- Hear, hear! - Hear, hear!

00:17:14.599 --> 00:17:15.160
Cheers!

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:16.359
- Cheers! - Cheers!

00:17:17.799 --> 00:17:18.880
We're going to make a fortune!

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:21.559
The good times are coming!

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:24.440
- Come on! - Drink up!

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:25.319
Fill every bowl!

00:17:25.559 --> 00:17:26.720
Come on!

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.160
- Have another! - Come on!

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:29.799
Soon we'll be living like kings.

00:17:29.799 --> 00:17:30.440
That's right!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:37.839
Why is that courtyard

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:40.680
So bright?

00:17:44.599 --> 00:17:45.599
That's salt.

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:47.119
They're gathering it up

00:17:47.279 --> 00:17:48.680
To create a snow scene.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:50.920
Salt prices are soaring in Huaying.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.480
Ordinary people can barely afford it.

00:17:53.799 --> 00:17:55.480
What family would waste salt like this?

00:17:55.599 --> 00:17:56.960
The County Magistrate's.

00:17:57.279 --> 00:17:58.039
His name is Fu.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:17:59.839
They held a banquet earlier today.

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:00.759
They called it

00:18:00.759 --> 00:18:01.839
A feast for the Flower Goddess Festival.

00:18:02.119 --> 00:18:04.480
They made flowers out of silk

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:06.200
And scattered salt to look like snow.

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:08.599
You think it's ten thousand catties of fine salt.

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:09.359
They just wanted it

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.039
Clean and pretty.

00:18:12.519 --> 00:18:13.279
The County Magistrate?

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:16.359
If they can keep

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:20.240
Its salt so spotless,

00:18:21.759 --> 00:18:23.440
Then the only dirty thing must be the money.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:36.799
Here, darling.

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:40.480
A man can take the imperial examinations

00:18:40.599 --> 00:18:42.440
And win wealth and status for himself.

00:18:42.839 --> 00:18:43.920
But a woman

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:45.319
Can only gain them through marriage.

00:18:48.039 --> 00:18:49.559
Look at this scene in the play.

00:18:50.039 --> 00:18:52.640
A young lady waits faithfully by the bridge

00:18:53.039 --> 00:18:55.359
Until a scholar on his way to the examinations appears.

00:18:55.839 --> 00:18:58.200
She gives him gold and silver

00:18:58.279 --> 00:18:59.720
To pay for his journey.

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:01.960
They make a promise:

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.559
"If you pass with high honors,

00:19:03.799 --> 00:19:05.440
Do not forget me."

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:09.839
But what if

00:19:10.359 --> 00:19:11.720
The scholar

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:13.119
Is not learned enough

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:14.880
And returns without success?

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:16.480
Or perhaps

00:19:16.839 --> 00:19:17.839
He simply

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:20.000
Has no interest in the lady at all?

00:19:20.359 --> 00:19:21.960
And so, you see,

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:24.640
After Mr. Zhang leaves,

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:28.000
She waits for Mr. Wang, Mr. Li, and Mr. Zhao.

00:19:28.519 --> 00:19:30.359
The lady reasons,

00:19:30.759 --> 00:19:32.960
"If I give my handkerchief to enough scholars,

00:19:33.359 --> 00:19:35.440
Surely one of them will pass.

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:36.720
Isn't that so?"

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:40.720
We are

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:43.480
A family of standing.

00:19:44.279 --> 00:19:46.839
(Chastity Honored Through the Ages) And with those three arches at our gate,

00:19:47.079 --> 00:19:49.519
I will make certain you marry above your station.

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:51.320
Okay.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:58.400
At the Flower Goddess Festival,

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:00.440
You saw thirteen beauties.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.279
Which one caught your eye?

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:04.799
The Ninth Young Lady, of course.

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:06.480
It was plain to see

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:08.359
That you were fond of her.

00:20:09.519 --> 00:20:11.160
Young as she is,

00:20:11.559 --> 00:20:12.880
She knows when to sacrifice a small advantage

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:13.880
To protect the greater good.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.640
And she remained perfectly composed in a crisis.

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:18.480
She carries herself with a certain nobility.

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:21.519
She has the makings of someone remarkable.

00:20:22.119 --> 00:20:23.480
But the Fu family

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.240
Was none the wiser.

00:20:27.279 --> 00:20:28.559
The imperial court

00:20:28.559 --> 00:20:30.160
Is investigating the salt trade and tax revenues.

00:20:30.359 --> 00:20:31.519
Yet the Fu family

00:20:31.519 --> 00:20:33.039
Tried to win my favor

00:20:33.039 --> 00:20:34.400
By wasting salt to create a spectacle.

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.799
The Fifth Master may have risen to the fifth rank,

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:41.279
But his post carries no real power.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:43.599
The men of the family are of little use,

00:20:43.759 --> 00:20:45.759
So they rely on chastity memorial arches to advance their careers.

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:47.200
Otherwise,

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:49.480
(Lewd books like The Carnal Prayer Mat) why let a widow run wild like this?

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.640
You shameless wretch!

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.160
I used to turn a blind eye to your behavior.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:03.440
You showed no gratitude,

00:21:03.839 --> 00:21:05.000
And now you've lost all sense.

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:07.440
How dare you jeopardize the Ninth Young Lady's marriage?

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:10.720
It no longer matters how much I favor her.

00:21:11.079 --> 00:21:12.079
Our family

00:21:12.079 --> 00:21:13.400
Is on the rise,

00:21:13.799 --> 00:21:15.599
While theirs is in decline.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:17.799
It would be a poor match for us.

00:21:20.519 --> 00:21:21.519
Mother.

00:21:22.079 --> 00:21:23.559
Please remember that my daughter-in-law

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:25.799
Has remained a widow for our family for ten years.

00:21:26.359 --> 00:21:28.119
Show her some leniency.

00:21:28.839 --> 00:21:30.880
Eldest Master has greased the right palms.

00:21:31.079 --> 00:21:32.240
In a few more years,

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:34.319
The masters' promotions will be secured.

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:37.119
We cannot let all that effort go to waste.

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:40.519
Tingyun is still unmarried.

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:42.400
If her reputation is ruined,

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:44.400
At best, she'll marry beneath her.

00:21:44.839 --> 00:21:45.960
At worst, it could cost her life.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:48.839
What do you think she intended?

00:21:50.599 --> 00:21:51.839
I'm sure you know.

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:57.000
Zuo.

00:22:01.039 --> 00:22:02.119
Yes.

00:22:02.119 --> 00:22:04.200
Even if you destroy Tingyun,

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:06.000
I will never marry her

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:08.359
To that worthless brother of yours.

00:22:11.480 --> 00:22:13.160
Take Madam Zuo away.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:14.920
If she means to be a virtuous widow,

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:17.319
She should remain quietly in her chambers

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:19.680
And copy Lessons in Female Virtue and Admonitions for Women a few times.

00:22:20.359 --> 00:22:22.000
(Grace Lost, Virtue Enduring) She must not leave without cause.

00:22:29.920 --> 00:22:32.600
(Huaying County)

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:36.119
White as snow.

00:22:36.119 --> 00:22:37.000
Fine as dust.

00:22:37.559 --> 00:22:38.880
Salt of this quality

00:22:39.559 --> 00:22:40.480
Is hard to come by.

00:22:41.079 --> 00:22:42.000
Twenty copper coins a tael.

00:22:42.519 --> 00:22:43.759
Do you want it or not?

00:22:44.359 --> 00:22:45.480
Do you have an official permit?

00:22:45.640 --> 00:22:47.000
You must be joking.

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:49.599
If this were government salt,

00:22:50.559 --> 00:22:51.920
It wouldn't be this cheap.

00:22:53.319 --> 00:22:54.480
No salt permit?

00:22:54.759 --> 00:22:55.920
Then it's contraband.

00:22:56.240 --> 00:22:56.960
These days,

00:22:56.960 --> 00:22:58.240
The authorities are cracking down hard.

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:00.160
I wouldn't dare stock illegal salt.

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:04.079
This is called Ground Snow.

00:23:04.599 --> 00:23:05.400
In the entire northwest,

00:23:06.039 --> 00:23:07.039
I'm the only one who has it.

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:09.279
Whether you make a fortune from it

00:23:10.279 --> 00:23:11.720
Is entirely up to you.

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:16.119
I'll take it.

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:20.400
(Yang Yucheng, Salt Smuggler)

00:23:20.400 --> 00:23:22.119
It's just business, whoever you're dealing with.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:23.559
Go.

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:24.200
Hurry.

00:23:25.359 --> 00:23:26.880
How much Ground Snow do you have?

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:28.120
(Sen)

00:23:28.359 --> 00:23:29.519
I want a hundred thousand catties.

00:23:33.799 --> 00:23:34.799
I'm going out for a meal.

00:23:35.119 --> 00:23:35.759
I'll tell you when I get back.

00:23:50.920 --> 00:23:52.720
Is there any dirty money you won't touch?

00:23:57.119 --> 00:23:57.559
After him!

00:23:57.640 --> 00:23:58.000
Hurry!

00:23:58.000 --> 00:23:58.599
Zhao Ling!

00:23:58.599 --> 00:23:59.119
This way!

00:23:59.359 --> 00:23:59.960
That way!

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:14.880
Sen, how many times have I told you?

00:24:15.519 --> 00:24:16.720
You'll kill someone hitting them like that.

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:18.240
You can't get blood on your hands.

00:24:41.279 --> 00:24:41.880
Sen.

00:25:14.559 --> 00:25:16.079
I knew you had it.

00:25:37.960 --> 00:25:38.440
Out of the way!

00:25:38.440 --> 00:25:39.000
Move!

00:25:39.960 --> 00:25:40.599
Officer!

00:25:40.599 --> 00:25:41.799
Someone is selling illegal salt here.

00:25:42.359 --> 00:25:43.000
Open up!

00:25:43.000 --> 00:25:43.519
Open the door!

00:25:43.799 --> 00:25:45.359
- Open the door! - Open up!

00:25:45.480 --> 00:25:46.119
Open up!

00:25:46.119 --> 00:25:46.720
Open the door!

00:26:02.759 --> 00:26:03.319
This way!

00:26:03.720 --> 00:26:04.160
Hurry!

00:26:04.920 --> 00:26:05.680
What are you doing?

00:26:07.799 --> 00:26:08.400
Stop!

00:26:10.920 --> 00:26:11.599
My Lord.

00:26:12.240 --> 00:26:13.079
Save me.

00:26:13.440 --> 00:26:14.880
They're salt smugglers.

00:26:16.440 --> 00:26:17.640
They're trying to silence me.

00:26:18.640 --> 00:26:20.720
You truly have no shame.

00:26:24.759 --> 00:26:26.119
And who are you?

00:26:42.680 --> 00:26:44.119
I serve the imperial court.

00:26:48.079 --> 00:26:49.839
I'm here to arrest salt smugglers.

00:26:49.839 --> 00:26:50.160
I...

00:26:50.160 --> 00:26:50.960
I have intelligence.

00:26:52.200 --> 00:26:54.559
Illegal salt is hidden in the third house

00:26:55.519 --> 00:26:56.720
On Anping Lane.

00:26:59.079 --> 00:27:00.400
There is more at Cangxue House

00:27:00.920 --> 00:27:02.119
On Ningde Street.

00:27:03.440 --> 00:27:05.119
A full hundred thousand catties.

00:27:06.640 --> 00:27:07.799
Send men to seize it at once,

00:27:09.079 --> 00:27:11.039
Before the thieves get there first.

00:27:17.880 --> 00:27:18.559
Mother.

00:27:19.119 --> 00:27:19.680
Mother.

00:27:20.640 --> 00:27:21.480
Wonderful news.

00:27:21.880 --> 00:27:23.200
The best news imaginable.

00:27:23.319 --> 00:27:25.759
What happened? Why the rush?

00:27:26.000 --> 00:27:27.759
The court has sent an Imperial Envoy.

00:27:27.880 --> 00:27:29.799
He is the son of the Imperial Salt Censor,

00:27:29.960 --> 00:27:31.519
Sent ahead to prepare for his father's arrival.

00:27:32.119 --> 00:27:33.359
Mr. Zhao

00:27:33.480 --> 00:27:34.759
Identified three storehouses

00:27:34.839 --> 00:27:36.440
Containing a hundred thousand catties of salt.

00:27:37.480 --> 00:27:38.799
I sent men to investigate,

00:27:39.279 --> 00:27:40.279
And it turned out to be

00:27:40.279 --> 00:27:42.200
Top-grade Ground Snow.

00:27:42.200 --> 00:27:43.960
(Western Capital Salt Transport Bureau) All contraband was seized.

00:27:44.200 --> 00:27:45.319
This was reported to the court,

00:27:45.319 --> 00:27:46.839
And your son earned great merit.

00:27:51.319 --> 00:27:53.799
How old is this Mr. Zhao?

00:27:54.839 --> 00:27:56.319
Has he earned any academic honors?

00:27:57.759 --> 00:27:59.440
And is he married?

00:28:07.200 --> 00:28:08.359
Where are we?

00:28:11.559 --> 00:28:12.480
The Magistrate's residence.

00:28:14.559 --> 00:28:15.519
We came

00:28:15.960 --> 00:28:17.079
To Huaying

00:28:18.079 --> 00:28:19.920
To investigate the salt-smuggling case.

00:28:20.200 --> 00:28:21.240
But we never expected

00:28:21.240 --> 00:28:23.559
To be cornered by those smugglers in the salt shop.

00:28:24.240 --> 00:28:25.279
We barely escaped with our lives.

00:28:26.640 --> 00:28:29.279
Fortunately, Magistrate Fu arrived just in time

00:28:29.400 --> 00:28:30.559
And rescued us.

00:28:31.119 --> 00:28:33.200
He even brought us here to recover.

00:28:34.640 --> 00:28:35.440
So,

00:28:36.480 --> 00:28:37.880
We are now staying

00:28:37.880 --> 00:28:40.200
In the west-side quarters of the Fu Residence.

00:28:41.759 --> 00:28:42.599
Mr. Zhao.

00:28:42.680 --> 00:28:43.720
My uncle has sent men

00:28:43.880 --> 00:28:44.799
(Fu Tingzhuo, Seventh Young Master) to Anping Lane.

00:28:44.880 --> 00:28:46.160
All the Ground Snow stored there

00:28:46.160 --> 00:28:47.319
Has been seized.

00:28:47.559 --> 00:28:48.680
So quickly.

00:28:49.759 --> 00:28:50.960
Every last bit.

00:28:51.640 --> 00:28:53.039
As expected.

00:28:55.640 --> 00:28:57.079
No case ever lingers on his desk.

00:28:59.640 --> 00:29:01.359
Rest well, Mr. Zhao.

00:29:01.359 --> 00:29:02.519
We shall take our leave.

00:29:09.759 --> 00:29:10.160
Wait.

00:29:10.559 --> 00:29:12.200
All our goods are gone.

00:29:12.200 --> 00:29:13.359
What are we going to tell the others?

00:29:17.039 --> 00:29:19.279
The authorities may have seized the salt,

00:29:20.839 --> 00:29:23.759
But as long as we get paid for it

00:29:25.599 --> 00:29:27.319
From the state coffers,

00:29:28.440 --> 00:29:30.319
It will be as good as sold.

00:29:30.799 --> 00:29:33.119
Then we'll split the official silver among the men.

00:29:34.440 --> 00:29:35.279
That'll sound even more impressive.

00:29:36.799 --> 00:29:38.279
You can do that?

00:29:39.480 --> 00:29:40.119
What else would we do?

00:29:40.119 --> 00:29:41.279
Do you have a better idea?

00:29:42.359 --> 00:29:43.400
What's the first rule

00:29:43.400 --> 00:29:44.359
Of surviving out here?

00:29:44.920 --> 00:29:46.240
If words will do,

00:29:46.240 --> 00:29:47.400
Never use your fists.

00:29:47.400 --> 00:29:48.880
If fists will do, never spend money.

00:29:48.880 --> 00:29:51.079
And if money will do, never risk your life.

00:29:51.960 --> 00:29:53.160
I'll remember that, Mr. Zhao.

00:29:54.279 --> 00:29:54.680
Call me

00:29:54.680 --> 00:29:55.480
Young Master.

00:29:56.400 --> 00:29:57.599
Young Master.

00:29:57.599 --> 00:30:00.119
I am now the son of the Imperial Salt Censor,

00:30:00.720 --> 00:30:02.200
An imperial envoy.

00:30:02.319 --> 00:30:04.160
No one does it like you, Young Master.

00:30:04.160 --> 00:30:04.640
He...

00:30:04.640 --> 00:30:05.640
Mr. Zhao, you...

00:30:16.440 --> 00:30:17.640
My knees have gone numb.

00:30:24.519 --> 00:30:25.599
I forgot to ask earlier.

00:30:25.920 --> 00:30:27.319
Would you like to write home

00:30:27.319 --> 00:30:28.680
And let your family know you're safe?

00:30:33.799 --> 00:30:35.279
The roads beyond the city are overrun with refugees,

00:30:35.279 --> 00:30:36.279
And travel is difficult.

00:30:36.759 --> 00:30:38.240
I wouldn't want to trouble you.

00:30:40.400 --> 00:30:41.079
But

00:30:41.319 --> 00:30:43.279
Won't your parents

00:30:43.519 --> 00:30:44.400
Get worried?

00:30:46.519 --> 00:30:48.160
They don't know I've been injured.

00:30:49.039 --> 00:30:50.680
What about your wife and children?

00:30:50.839 --> 00:30:51.599
Won't they worry?

00:30:56.559 --> 00:30:57.519
No.

00:30:58.400 --> 00:30:59.799
I have yet to marry.

00:31:00.599 --> 00:31:01.960
I have neither wife nor children.

00:31:04.759 --> 00:31:06.000
Not yet married...

00:31:06.640 --> 00:31:07.839
Get some rest, Young Master.

00:31:10.279 --> 00:31:11.680
Not yet married...

00:31:15.240 --> 00:31:16.039
That hurts.

00:31:18.400 --> 00:31:19.440
Madam Yu.

00:31:22.079 --> 00:31:23.599
Congratulations, Old Madam.

00:31:23.759 --> 00:31:25.160
Congratulations, Eldest Madam.

00:31:25.519 --> 00:31:27.640
I hear Eldest Master Fu has crushed a band of salt smugglers

00:31:27.640 --> 00:31:29.559
And seized tens of thousands of catties of Ground Snow.

00:31:29.920 --> 00:31:31.519
Such a remarkable achievement

00:31:31.680 --> 00:31:33.160
Will surely be rewarded by the imperial court.

00:31:35.039 --> 00:31:36.839
Lord Yu serves in the Censorate.

00:31:36.839 --> 00:31:39.240
When the officials' performance is reviewed,

00:31:39.240 --> 00:31:40.720
We shall be counting on his support.

00:31:46.480 --> 00:31:47.200
Mother.

00:31:47.720 --> 00:31:49.079
Mr. Zhao

00:31:49.079 --> 00:31:50.680
Heard that the elders of the family were here

00:31:50.920 --> 00:31:51.920
And asked to pay a visit

00:31:52.079 --> 00:31:53.480
To offer you his respects.

00:31:53.480 --> 00:31:54.519
Very well.

00:32:11.440 --> 00:32:12.000
Madam Yu.

00:32:26.960 --> 00:32:27.680
Mr. Zhao.

00:32:32.319 --> 00:32:33.680
My respects, ladies.

00:32:42.079 --> 00:32:45.119
His father is the Imperial Salt Censor of Liangzhe Circuit,

00:32:45.200 --> 00:32:46.599
An imperial envoy.

00:32:47.079 --> 00:32:48.519
He is investigating the case on his father's behalf

00:32:48.799 --> 00:32:50.359
And is staying in the west-side quarters.

00:32:50.519 --> 00:32:51.559
Tingzhuo,

00:32:51.799 --> 00:32:53.640
See that our honored guest is well looked after.

00:32:53.799 --> 00:32:55.640
We meant well.

00:32:56.039 --> 00:32:58.720
We mustn't let a small oversight in his sleeping arrangements

00:32:58.880 --> 00:33:00.160
Displease our guest.

00:33:00.279 --> 00:33:01.799
That would never do.

00:33:02.000 --> 00:33:03.440
Rest assured, Old Madam.

00:33:03.680 --> 00:33:05.240
I never intended to impose upon your household.

00:33:05.799 --> 00:33:07.000
It is just that

00:33:07.079 --> 00:33:08.759
Securing the funds

00:33:09.920 --> 00:33:12.000
Needed for the investigation will take some time.

00:33:12.319 --> 00:33:13.799
Secure the funds?

00:33:15.400 --> 00:33:17.359
The brute who injured me

00:33:17.759 --> 00:33:19.279
Takes orders from Jiuweijiao.

00:33:19.680 --> 00:33:20.920
Jiuweijiao

00:33:20.920 --> 00:33:22.400
- not only keeps hired thugs, - Jiuweijiao?

00:33:22.400 --> 00:33:23.839
But also hoards weapons in secret.

00:33:24.599 --> 00:33:25.640
I would like

00:33:25.640 --> 00:33:27.319
To avoid unnecessary bloodshed.

00:33:27.880 --> 00:33:30.920
So I intend to set the bait,

00:33:31.640 --> 00:33:33.079
Using ten thousand taels of silver as the lure.

00:33:33.319 --> 00:33:34.440
We'll pretend to arrange a deal

00:33:34.440 --> 00:33:35.599
And draw him out.

00:33:39.000 --> 00:33:40.319
Unfortunately,

00:33:40.799 --> 00:33:42.519
Here in Huaying,

00:33:43.480 --> 00:33:44.799
I have few useful connections,

00:33:45.359 --> 00:33:47.079
And I did not bring enough money.

00:33:47.200 --> 00:33:48.480
For the moment,

00:33:49.400 --> 00:33:50.759
I can't put the plan into motion.

00:33:51.279 --> 00:33:51.720
Well...

00:33:54.359 --> 00:33:55.039
How about

00:33:55.039 --> 00:33:56.799
We lend some money to you?

00:33:58.200 --> 00:33:59.720
Set the bait?

00:34:00.039 --> 00:34:01.240
But you have neither a hook

00:34:03.319 --> 00:34:04.720
Nor any bait.

00:34:10.039 --> 00:34:11.079
This is

00:34:11.320 --> 00:34:13.039
Madam Yu of Yongning Prefecture.

00:34:13.519 --> 00:34:15.840
Her husband holds office in the capital.

00:34:17.000 --> 00:34:18.079
Mr. Zhao.

00:34:18.719 --> 00:34:20.519
I've been away from the capital for several years.

00:34:21.480 --> 00:34:23.559
Are the elders of your household keeping well?

00:34:55.559 --> 00:34:56.599
My respects, Madam.

00:34:57.760 --> 00:34:59.199
Meeting an old acquaintance far from home

00:34:59.480 --> 00:35:00.559
Is one of life's great joys.

00:35:02.039 --> 00:35:02.840
Hardly.

00:35:03.079 --> 00:35:04.800
The last time I visited your residence

00:35:04.800 --> 00:35:06.280
Was three years ago.

00:35:12.519 --> 00:35:13.639
We...

00:35:18.199 --> 00:35:18.960
Met before.

00:35:22.400 --> 00:35:24.159
The male and female guests dined separately.

00:35:24.400 --> 00:35:25.880
You and I have never met.

00:35:32.039 --> 00:35:33.480
Then I must have been

00:35:35.360 --> 00:35:36.559
Remiss in my manners.

00:35:40.960 --> 00:35:42.280
At your wedding banquet,

00:35:42.440 --> 00:35:43.679
Mr. Zhao,

00:35:45.039 --> 00:35:45.960
You were

00:35:45.960 --> 00:35:47.159
Too busy to attend to every guest.

00:35:47.880 --> 00:35:49.119
Wedding banquet?

00:35:49.760 --> 00:35:51.199
You're married?

00:35:57.000 --> 00:35:58.800
I later heard

00:35:59.159 --> 00:36:00.559
You were blessed with a son.

00:36:00.559 --> 00:36:02.199
Your household could then boast

00:36:02.199 --> 00:36:03.320
Four generations under one roof.

00:36:03.400 --> 00:36:05.079
And even has a child?

00:36:07.960 --> 00:36:08.800
Didn't Tingzhuo say

00:36:08.800 --> 00:36:10.400
Mr. Zhao had no family?

00:36:11.039 --> 00:36:12.079
A boy or a girl?

00:36:22.400 --> 00:36:24.239
I had no wish to speak of it.

00:36:31.599 --> 00:36:33.159
But since you insist on asking...

00:36:36.960 --> 00:36:38.079
The child...

00:36:44.719 --> 00:36:45.840
The child...

00:36:52.679 --> 00:36:53.760
Died in infancy.

00:36:56.360 --> 00:36:58.400
My father feared I would be consumed by grief,

00:36:58.880 --> 00:37:01.000
So he sent me traveling

00:37:04.199 --> 00:37:05.960
To ease the pain of my loss.

00:37:06.360 --> 00:37:07.280
Yes.

00:37:11.679 --> 00:37:13.079
Your wife is still young.

00:37:13.360 --> 00:37:15.079
You will have more children.

00:37:15.440 --> 00:37:17.079
Is she taking any restorative medicine?

00:37:17.079 --> 00:37:18.840
My family has an excellent prescription.

00:37:18.840 --> 00:37:20.280
I can have it prepared

00:37:20.280 --> 00:37:21.960
And ask Fifth Master to have it delivered,

00:37:21.960 --> 00:37:23.440
So she can begin taking it at once.

00:37:23.440 --> 00:37:24.960
My wife and child...

00:37:28.960 --> 00:37:30.199
Passed away together.

00:37:38.519 --> 00:37:40.000
In my view,

00:37:40.159 --> 00:37:42.679
Mr. Zhao, you are blessed with good fortune.

00:37:43.199 --> 00:37:44.119
In time,

00:37:44.119 --> 00:37:45.719
You will marry again.

00:37:46.280 --> 00:37:47.280
Of course.

00:37:47.400 --> 00:37:49.000
You are still young.

00:37:49.000 --> 00:37:50.360
Very young indeed.

00:37:50.440 --> 00:37:51.679
Exactly.

00:37:52.840 --> 00:37:54.400
Let us hope so.

00:38:02.280 --> 00:38:05.039
The Imperial Salt Censor may not rank highly,

00:38:05.159 --> 00:38:06.679
But it is a highly lucrative post.

00:38:07.000 --> 00:38:09.639
He even has the Emperor's ear.

00:38:09.840 --> 00:38:11.679
If we can arrange this marriage,

00:38:11.679 --> 00:38:13.000
It would be an excellent match.

00:38:14.280 --> 00:38:15.360
Madam Yu

00:38:15.719 --> 00:38:17.119
And her son

00:38:17.679 --> 00:38:19.400
Are still staying under our roof.

00:38:20.000 --> 00:38:21.079
Madam Yu

00:38:21.320 --> 00:38:22.880
Did not choose you.

00:38:23.039 --> 00:38:24.840
Why waste your time

00:38:24.920 --> 00:38:26.400
Waiting for her to change her mind?

00:38:27.840 --> 00:38:29.280
I just feel

00:38:29.880 --> 00:38:31.239
That Mr. Zhao's arrival

00:38:31.480 --> 00:38:33.199
Was a little too convenient.

00:38:33.400 --> 00:38:36.079
Better to arrive at the right moment than the earliest.

00:38:36.840 --> 00:38:39.519
Is it because he was married and had a child?

00:38:40.360 --> 00:38:42.239
His wife and child are both gone.

00:38:42.960 --> 00:38:44.320
A man who has been married before

00:38:44.639 --> 00:38:45.800
Knows how to cherish his wife.

00:38:46.519 --> 00:38:47.519
Exactly.

00:38:53.159 --> 00:38:54.119
(Fu Residence) Lord Yu

00:38:54.119 --> 00:38:55.440
Can advance your father's career,

00:38:56.079 --> 00:38:58.000
While Mr. Zhao can help your eldest uncle.

00:38:59.119 --> 00:39:00.559
Both proposed marriages

00:39:01.199 --> 00:39:03.280
Would trade your future for the men's advancement.

00:39:04.360 --> 00:39:05.599
At least we know

00:39:05.800 --> 00:39:06.880
The Yu family well.

00:39:07.599 --> 00:39:08.880
But what if Zhao Ling

00:39:08.880 --> 00:39:10.159
Is an impostor?

00:39:24.320 --> 00:39:25.679
All they see is the salt,

00:39:26.519 --> 00:39:27.480
Not the man.

00:39:28.960 --> 00:39:30.679
They are not afraid that Zhao Ling is a fraud

00:39:30.679 --> 00:39:31.960
And that my whole life will be ruined.

00:39:32.719 --> 00:39:34.480
They are afraid he might be genuine

00:39:34.599 --> 00:39:37.199
And they might miss their chance to gain influence and promotion.

00:39:40.079 --> 00:39:41.639
The Fu family's stake

00:39:42.400 --> 00:39:44.719
Has never been gold or silver.

00:39:45.679 --> 00:39:47.360
It has always been its unmarried daughters.

00:39:53.400 --> 00:39:54.519
Then

00:39:55.719 --> 00:39:56.880
Ask your seventh brother for help?

00:39:58.800 --> 00:40:00.280
Seventh Young Master has always protected you.

00:40:00.280 --> 00:40:01.480
He is an upright man.

00:40:02.000 --> 00:40:03.639
He would never join hands with a swindler.

00:40:07.119 --> 00:40:08.199
That may work.

00:40:11.480 --> 00:40:12.360
As it happens,

00:40:12.360 --> 00:40:14.119
I brought two pots of narcissus today.

00:40:14.800 --> 00:40:16.039
When you see him,

00:40:16.719 --> 00:40:18.159
You could give him one.

00:40:23.159 --> 00:40:25.159
Just have Yuwei trim the wick with scissors.

00:40:25.519 --> 00:40:27.280
You always use a gold hairpin to tend the lampwick.

00:40:28.000 --> 00:40:29.239
I know you're wealthy,

00:40:29.599 --> 00:40:31.480
But you shouldn't ruin fine things like that.

00:40:33.280 --> 00:40:34.599
It was simply the first thing to hand.

00:40:37.559 --> 00:40:39.599
Yake is another name for the narcissus.

00:40:39.840 --> 00:40:41.199
Miss Fan wants you

00:40:41.199 --> 00:40:42.440
To play matchmaker for her.

00:40:42.760 --> 00:40:44.559
Shall we deliver it for her?

00:40:45.239 --> 00:40:47.159
Yake has no powerful family behind her.

00:40:48.079 --> 00:40:49.960
If she truly married into our family,

00:40:50.920 --> 00:40:52.239
Her position

00:40:52.480 --> 00:40:54.320
Might be even worse than Zuo's.

00:40:56.840 --> 00:40:58.079
Keep the flowers here for now.

00:40:58.519 --> 00:40:59.800
When I find the right opportunity,

00:40:59.800 --> 00:41:01.079
I'll explain everything to her.

00:41:02.360 --> 00:41:02.960
All right.

00:41:04.519 --> 00:41:05.239
(Tingzhuo.)

00:41:05.360 --> 00:41:07.079
(I suspect Zhao Ling is an impostor.)

00:41:07.239 --> 00:41:08.280
(Help me test him.)

00:41:08.719 --> 00:41:09.559
(Tell him)

00:41:09.559 --> 00:41:10.519
(you've written a letter)

00:41:10.840 --> 00:41:12.239
(and ask him to deliver it on his way back to the capital)

00:41:12.239 --> 00:41:13.920
(to Master Cao in Tong County.)

00:41:14.639 --> 00:41:15.920
(Say he's Zhao Ling's brother-in-law.)

00:41:16.400 --> 00:41:17.840
(If he agrees,)

00:41:18.440 --> 00:41:20.280
(that will prove he is an impostor,)

00:41:20.440 --> 00:41:21.199
(because)

00:41:21.199 --> 00:41:22.960
(I made the brother-in-law up.)

00:41:25.559 --> 00:41:26.840
Sorry to have kept you waiting, Mr. Zhao.

00:41:27.119 --> 00:41:28.000
A small token

00:41:28.280 --> 00:41:29.199
Of our appreciation.

00:41:32.320 --> 00:41:33.719
You shouldn't have gone to such expense, Mr. Fu.

00:41:34.639 --> 00:41:35.840
When the matter is reported to the imperial court,

00:41:36.440 --> 00:41:38.159
I will ensure Magistrate Fu receives the highest credit.

00:41:40.280 --> 00:41:41.719
That is most kind of you, Mr. Zhao.

00:41:43.000 --> 00:41:44.079
But I haven't come today

00:41:44.159 --> 00:41:44.960
On official business.

00:41:45.199 --> 00:41:46.039
The truth is,

00:41:46.639 --> 00:41:48.159
There is another matter I'd like to discuss.

00:41:48.159 --> 00:41:49.079
Mr. Fu,

00:41:49.480 --> 00:41:50.360
Please speak freely.

00:41:51.199 --> 00:41:52.360
In a few months,

00:41:52.639 --> 00:41:54.000
I will travel to the capital for the imperial examination.

00:41:55.039 --> 00:41:57.039
I heard your wife's elder brother

00:41:57.320 --> 00:41:58.679
Holds office in Tong County.

00:41:59.239 --> 00:42:00.079
Would you

00:42:00.079 --> 00:42:01.679
Write me a letter

00:42:01.679 --> 00:42:02.559
Of recommendation

00:42:03.159 --> 00:42:04.000
And have him vouch for me?

00:42:06.559 --> 00:42:06.960
(My)

00:42:07.440 --> 00:42:08.199
(brother-in-law?)

00:42:12.040 --> 00:42:14.480
(Next Episode)

00:42:17.039 --> 00:42:18.079
I heard

00:42:18.199 --> 00:42:20.719
Feng Laosi, the salt merchant, has bad blood with Jiuweijiao.

00:42:21.119 --> 00:42:22.679
Why don't we turn the situation to our advantage?

00:42:23.039 --> 00:42:23.679
Take them down!

00:42:23.800 --> 00:42:25.599
We'll let someone else deal with the fraud for us.

00:42:26.599 --> 00:42:28.519
(Wanted Notice) Zhao Ling and his accomplice

00:42:28.519 --> 00:42:30.119
Infiltrated the Fu Residence in Huaying

00:42:30.400 --> 00:42:32.199
And fraudulently obtained

00:42:32.199 --> 00:42:33.039
Ten thousand taels of silver.

00:42:34.239 --> 00:42:35.599
(Fu Residence) At first, I thought

00:42:35.840 --> 00:42:37.199
If we lost that money,

00:42:37.920 --> 00:42:39.159
Then so be it.

00:42:39.719 --> 00:42:41.480
But after what happened today,

00:42:42.119 --> 00:42:43.599
I can't just let this go.

00:42:56.440 --> 00:43:00.760
♪The past brushes by like a falling leaf♪

00:43:04.360 --> 00:43:08.720
♪So light, yet my steps still pause for you♪

00:43:10.840 --> 00:43:15.480
♪Through every rise and fall, our memories remain without regret♪

00:43:15.720 --> 00:43:18.520
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

00:43:19.680 --> 00:43:24.320
♪How I wish I could stay a little longer, but I can't♪

00:43:27.520 --> 00:43:34.360
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill my eyes with tears♪

00:43:35.240 --> 00:43:41.760
♪Etched deep within my heart, yet buried without a word♪

00:43:42.720 --> 00:43:46.160
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

00:43:46.680 --> 00:43:50.880
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:43:51.160 --> 00:43:56.840
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

00:44:08.960 --> 00:44:12.840
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you in the crowd♪

00:44:16.760 --> 00:44:20.760
♪Without a word, you lit up half my life♪

00:44:22.480 --> 00:44:27.160
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

00:44:27.480 --> 00:44:30.160
♪Kept close within my heart♪

00:44:31.240 --> 00:44:36.080
♪From now on, no one else is worth waiting for♪

00:44:39.600 --> 00:44:46.520
♪I turn away, afraid no one will ever come home to me again♪

00:44:47.400 --> 00:44:53.880
♪If we can build our future together, no storm can chill my heart♪

00:44:54.760 --> 00:44:58.280
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

00:44:58.720 --> 00:45:03.080
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:45:03.280 --> 00:45:09.000
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

